1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:33,324 --> 00:00:34,617
[Julio] <i>Wherever it is, you're not going.</i>

4
00:00:34,701 --> 00:00:37,495
<i>No, Papa! The lion is envious</i>
<i>of the lioness</i>

5
00:00:37,579 --> 00:00:39,330
<i>because you know that after that meeting,</i>

6
00:00:39,414 --> 00:00:41,791
<i>I'll become even more powerful than you,</i>

7
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:43,543
<i>and you don't want that. I know that.</i>

8
00:00:43,626 --> 00:00:44,878
[gunshot]

9
00:00:46,963 --> 00:00:49,090
[Arnaldo] <i>Ivy Aguas…</i>

10
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:51,301
<i>You killed the old Arnaldo.</i>

11
00:00:51,384 --> 00:00:53,595
<i>But now that my memories are back,</i>

12
00:00:53,678 --> 00:00:55,889
<i>I'll make you pay.</i>

13
00:00:55,972 --> 00:00:57,932
[Romulo] <i>Just make sure</i>
<i>you're loyal to Emilia.</i>

14
00:00:58,016 --> 00:01:00,310
<i>Otherwise, you'll get something</i>
<i>far worse than that.</i>

15
00:01:00,393 --> 00:01:02,687
<i>Make sure nothing happens to my daughter.</i>

16
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:03,980
<i>Diego, we're here.</i>

17
00:01:04,064 --> 00:01:06,191
<i>Don't come in yet.</i>
<i>Something doesn't feel right.</i>

18
00:01:06,274 --> 00:01:09,027
[gunfire]

19
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:10,904
[Lily] <i>This is a massacre, Agent Salonga!</i>

20
00:01:10,987 --> 00:01:12,113
[gunshots]

21
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:13,782
<i>-Let's go!</i>
<i>-Mercedes.</i>

22
00:01:13,865 --> 00:01:14,699
<i>Get up! Come on!</i>

23
00:01:14,783 --> 00:01:16,409
[gunshots]

24
00:01:16,493 --> 00:01:17,452
<i>Let's go.</i>

25
00:01:17,535 --> 00:01:18,870
<i>I won't go with you.</i>

26
00:01:18,953 --> 00:01:21,456
<i>If you don't come with me,</i>
<i>you'll die here!</i>

27
00:01:22,415 --> 00:01:24,959
<i>I can help you take Red Dragon down.</i>

28
00:01:25,043 --> 00:01:27,003
[Mercedes] <i>Leave me out</i>
<i>of your crazy schemes.</i>

29
00:01:27,086 --> 00:01:28,546
<i>I trust Red Dragon.</i>

30
00:01:28,630 --> 00:01:31,090
<i>And no matter what you say,</i>
<i>I will never side with you.</i>

31
00:01:31,174 --> 00:01:33,176
[Helena] <i>Get everyone here</i>

32
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:36,888
<i>because I already know who betrayed me.</i>

33
00:01:36,971 --> 00:01:37,972
<i>There's no turning back now.</i>

34
00:01:38,056 --> 00:01:40,975
<i>We're so close to taking Red Dragon down.</i>

35
00:01:41,059 --> 00:01:42,685
<i>Then you better take this.</i>

36
00:01:42,769 --> 00:01:43,853
<i>A tracking device.</i>

37
00:01:43,937 --> 00:01:45,522
<i>So we always know where you are.</i>

38
00:02:01,955 --> 00:02:03,039
Camia.

39
00:02:03,998 --> 00:02:05,375
Is something wrong?

40
00:02:06,835 --> 00:02:09,295
Damian, Agent Salonga just told us

41
00:02:09,379 --> 00:02:11,464
that Red Dragon is back.

42
00:02:11,548 --> 00:02:17,428
[tense music playing]

43
00:02:19,597 --> 00:02:20,807
[phone chimes]

44
00:02:31,818 --> 00:02:32,944
Damian.

45
00:02:33,528 --> 00:02:35,697
I have to go. I need to report to work.

46
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:38,074
All of a sudden?

47
00:02:39,284 --> 00:02:42,954
It's nothing. Just a
small emergency. Okay?

48
00:02:43,037 --> 00:02:44,873
Don't worry about it. I'll see you later.

49
00:02:47,083 --> 00:02:48,501
Okay, take care.

50
00:02:49,252 --> 00:02:50,253
Thanks.

51
00:02:51,254 --> 00:02:52,255
Damian.

52
00:02:53,548 --> 00:02:55,174
Be careful, okay?

53
00:02:55,258 --> 00:02:58,261
[soft music playing]

54
00:03:12,609 --> 00:03:15,194
[ominous music playing]

55
00:03:18,281 --> 00:03:20,950
[humming]

56
00:03:28,082 --> 00:03:29,959
[sighs]

57
00:03:45,433 --> 00:03:47,227
[sighs]

58
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:50,313
[suspenseful music playing]

59
00:03:58,029 --> 00:04:00,949
[suspenseful music continues]

60
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:22,512
THEY'RE TAKING OUR STUFF AWAY.

61
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:29,269
BUT YOU DON'T NEED TO WORRY.

62
00:04:39,237 --> 00:04:40,613
Boss Diego, it's your turn.

63
00:04:41,364 --> 00:04:43,491
Wait. What's going on here?

64
00:04:43,574 --> 00:04:45,285
Orders from Madam Red Dragon.

65
00:04:46,327 --> 00:04:47,662
You can't do this.

66
00:04:47,954 --> 00:04:49,330
Where is she? Let me talk to her.

67
00:04:49,414 --> 00:04:51,416
The Madam asks, a blindfold or a bullet?

68
00:04:51,499 --> 00:04:52,375
Your call.

69
00:04:52,458 --> 00:04:54,961
[suspenseful music playing]

70
00:05:22,113 --> 00:05:24,741
[suspenseful music playing]

71
00:05:44,302 --> 00:05:46,804
Lily, does that red dot
represent Diego's location?

72
00:05:47,764 --> 00:05:48,848
Yes, Mom.

73
00:05:49,515 --> 00:05:53,061
Does this mean that's where
Red Dragon's hideout is?

74
00:05:53,144 --> 00:05:54,479
It's possible, Mom.

75
00:05:55,146 --> 00:05:56,481
But we aren't really sure

76
00:05:56,564 --> 00:06:00,068
if she's there, so we can't
just launch an attack.

77
00:06:00,359 --> 00:06:01,611
What matters is…

78
00:06:02,278 --> 00:06:04,072
we can monitor Diego's movements.

79
00:06:13,956 --> 00:06:16,584
[tense music playing]

80
00:06:25,301 --> 00:06:27,428
I'm sure you already recognize my voice.

81
00:06:32,683 --> 00:06:34,644
Yes, I am back.

82
00:06:35,978 --> 00:06:37,522
Now, there's this saying…

83
00:06:38,397 --> 00:06:40,608
that a person's eyes…

84
00:06:42,110 --> 00:06:44,112
are the window to their soul.

85
00:06:45,738 --> 00:06:47,782
And that's why I had you all blindfolded.

86
00:06:48,658 --> 00:06:53,371
So that your souls can't
escape from your bodies.

87
00:06:54,831 --> 00:07:00,336
And I want your worthless
souls to burn along

88
00:07:00,419 --> 00:07:03,172
with your wretched bodies
when I'm done with them!

89
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:08,803
Now, each and every one of you…

90
00:07:10,096 --> 00:07:11,722
has a reason…

91
00:07:12,849 --> 00:07:14,559
to betray me.

92
00:07:16,936 --> 00:07:18,980
But there can only be one…

93
00:07:19,939 --> 00:07:22,275
Judas here.

94
00:07:23,651 --> 00:07:28,239
Now, if a person's eyes
are the window to their soul…

95
00:07:31,075 --> 00:07:33,953
then my bullets are more than ready…

96
00:07:36,330 --> 00:07:37,874
to give Judas a kiss.

97
00:07:39,250 --> 00:07:42,003
[tense music playing]

98
00:08:01,939 --> 00:08:02,940
[loads gun]

99
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:06,527
Eeny…

100
00:08:08,321 --> 00:08:09,489
Meeny…

101
00:08:11,365 --> 00:08:12,533
Miny…

102
00:08:13,826 --> 00:08:15,161
Moe. Moe, moe!

103
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:20,791
[tense music playing]

104
00:08:24,545 --> 00:08:26,547
Eeny, meeny, miny, moe, moe!

105
00:08:28,299 --> 00:08:29,258
Moe!

106
00:08:30,718 --> 00:08:33,137
[tense music playing]

107
00:08:43,147 --> 00:08:44,190
<i>Mama!</i>

108
00:08:45,608 --> 00:08:47,151
<i>Mama, welcome home!</i>

109
00:08:48,236 --> 00:08:49,737
<i>I so missed you.</i>

110
00:08:50,696 --> 00:08:52,490
<i>I came home as soon as you told me</i>

111
00:08:52,573 --> 00:08:54,450
<i>you finally know who betrayed me.</i>

112
00:08:55,201 --> 00:08:57,036
<i>Well, Mama, what I'm saying is true.</i>

113
00:08:57,578 --> 00:09:00,665
<i>I believe you because you're my baby girl.</i>

114
00:09:02,792 --> 00:09:05,044
<i>But that's such a strong accusation.</i>

115
00:09:05,753 --> 00:09:07,338
<i>I'll need proof.</i>

116
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:14,428
<i>One of the Dragon Ladies took a video</i>

117
00:09:14,512 --> 00:09:16,514
<i>of Lily Cruz saving Mercedes</i>

118
00:09:16,597 --> 00:09:18,724
<i>while the Big Four were being ambushed.</i>

119
00:09:19,308 --> 00:09:21,811
<i>I hope that's enough to prove that…</i>

120
00:09:22,436 --> 00:09:24,730
<i>your lackey's been betraying you.</i>

121
00:09:24,814 --> 00:09:26,691
[tense music playing]

122
00:09:32,029 --> 00:09:33,197
[loud thud]

123
00:09:34,365 --> 00:09:35,366
Ugh!

124
00:09:36,492 --> 00:09:39,662
[heavy breathing]

125
00:09:40,997 --> 00:09:42,623
Go ahead, baby girl.

126
00:09:43,958 --> 00:09:46,335
[tense music playing]

127
00:09:48,921 --> 00:09:52,049
Give the traitor their last kiss.

128
00:10:00,016 --> 00:10:04,020
[tense music playing]

129
00:10:15,072 --> 00:10:16,490
-[exhales]
-Emilia!

130
00:10:16,574 --> 00:10:18,618
-Do it now!
-I can't do it, Mama.

131
00:10:18,701 --> 00:10:20,453
[sobs] I can't do it, Mama.

132
00:10:20,745 --> 00:10:21,787
I can't…

133
00:10:22,455 --> 00:10:25,082
[tense music playing]

134
00:10:30,087 --> 00:10:31,339
[gunshot]

135
00:10:32,089 --> 00:10:33,341
[gunshot]

136
00:10:33,424 --> 00:10:34,592
[Emilia gasps]

137
00:10:34,675 --> 00:10:37,261
[tense music playing]

138
00:10:40,431 --> 00:10:42,308
Ah! [panicked breathing]

139
00:10:42,391 --> 00:10:43,392
Ah!

140
00:10:48,105 --> 00:10:52,777
[suspenseful music playing]

141
00:11:11,504 --> 00:11:12,671
[Emilia whispers] Arnaldo--

142
00:11:25,726 --> 00:11:26,727
[Emilia gasps]

143
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:31,190
Get rid of that.

144
00:11:37,530 --> 00:11:40,783
[tense music playing]

145
00:11:59,885 --> 00:12:02,263
[Emilia's breath quivers]

146
00:12:09,311 --> 00:12:12,690
[tense music continues playing]

147
00:12:47,933 --> 00:12:49,518
Thank you, Agent Salonga.

148
00:12:51,979 --> 00:12:53,606
Lily, any updates?

149
00:12:54,023 --> 00:12:55,858
My hunch was right, Mom.

150
00:12:55,941 --> 00:12:58,569
Red Dragon is back in the country.

151
00:13:00,404 --> 00:13:02,198
And someone betrayed her.

152
00:13:04,074 --> 00:13:05,326
What about Diego?

153
00:13:08,996 --> 00:13:09,997
[tracker beeps]

154
00:13:10,831 --> 00:13:13,626
[somber music playing]

155
00:13:31,060 --> 00:13:35,064
[suspenseful music playing]

156
00:13:49,203 --> 00:13:50,704
Mercedes isn't here.

157
00:13:50,788 --> 00:13:53,916
[suspenseful music continues]

158
00:14:11,642 --> 00:14:13,769
[Emilia] <i>Your lackey's been betraying you.</i>

159
00:14:15,271 --> 00:14:16,939
-[gunshot]
-[Emilia gasps]

160
00:14:25,489 --> 00:14:26,490
Mama?

161
00:14:28,117 --> 00:14:29,118
Are you okay?

162
00:14:29,201 --> 00:14:30,744
Yeah. [chuckles]

163
00:14:30,828 --> 00:14:32,371
Emilia, I'm okay.

164
00:14:33,497 --> 00:14:35,916
Don't feel bad. It's her fault.

165
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,084
She's a traitor.

166
00:14:37,167 --> 00:14:38,502
Of course.

167
00:14:39,712 --> 00:14:42,298
[sighs heavily]

168
00:14:43,632 --> 00:14:45,759
[Arnaldo humming]

169
00:14:52,057 --> 00:14:53,434
[chuckling]

170
00:14:53,517 --> 00:14:55,603
Arnaldo… You did great.

171
00:14:55,686 --> 00:14:56,770
Oh, thank you.

172
00:14:57,938 --> 00:14:59,315
Flower for the dead.

173
00:15:02,192 --> 00:15:04,403
Mama, why are you with Arnaldo?

174
00:15:05,446 --> 00:15:06,447
Emilia.

175
00:15:07,281 --> 00:15:08,866
When I was searching for you,

176
00:15:08,949 --> 00:15:12,077
I dug up everything about you.

177
00:15:12,703 --> 00:15:15,331
Including my grandson,

178
00:15:15,915 --> 00:15:18,250
the former mayor of Ardiente.

179
00:15:19,501 --> 00:15:20,878
Arnaldo…

180
00:15:21,712 --> 00:15:23,088
who's also…

181
00:15:24,089 --> 00:15:26,550
a cold-blooded killer.

182
00:15:30,137 --> 00:15:31,263
That's right.

183
00:15:31,972 --> 00:15:34,850
I went to grandma first after
everything came back to me.

184
00:15:35,267 --> 00:15:36,268
So, Mom…

185
00:15:37,478 --> 00:15:38,520
I'm back.

186
00:15:38,604 --> 00:15:41,565
[tense music playing]

187
00:15:58,582 --> 00:16:01,627
[music continues]

188
00:16:07,841 --> 00:16:08,926
<i>Hello, Grandma.</i>

189
00:16:10,344 --> 00:16:11,595
<i>I'm Arnaldo.</i>

190
00:16:12,763 --> 00:16:15,140
<i>Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo.</i>

191
00:16:16,725 --> 00:16:17,851
<i>Former mayor.</i>

192
00:16:17,935 --> 00:16:18,936
<i>Mm-hmm.</i>

193
00:16:19,019 --> 00:16:20,354
[Helena] <i>Favorite grandson…</i>

194
00:16:20,437 --> 00:16:21,730
<i>-…of Julio.</i>
<i>-Mm-hm.</i>

195
00:16:22,815 --> 00:16:24,108
<i>My grandson!</i>

196
00:16:25,025 --> 00:16:26,276
<i>Why are you here?</i>

197
00:16:26,902 --> 00:16:28,028
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

198
00:16:28,278 --> 00:16:29,655
<i>Why am I here?</i>

199
00:16:29,738 --> 00:16:31,281
<i>Aren't you happy to see me?</i>

200
00:16:31,365 --> 00:16:33,826
<i>Am I not welcome here in your lair?</i>

201
00:16:33,909 --> 00:16:35,035
[Helena] <i>But of course!</i>

202
00:16:35,119 --> 00:16:37,579
<i>But you know, the first time I met you,</i>

203
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:40,124
<i>you were still sick.</i>

204
00:16:40,582 --> 00:16:42,835
<i>Now, I can see that you're back!</i>

205
00:16:43,502 --> 00:16:44,378
<i>I'm back.</i>

206
00:16:46,338 --> 00:16:48,090
<i>My memories have returned.</i>

207
00:16:50,217 --> 00:16:52,011
<i>All the lies they fed me…</i>

208
00:16:52,761 --> 00:16:54,054
<i>All the pain…</i>

209
00:16:58,183 --> 00:16:59,518
<i>And I want revenge.</i>

210
00:17:02,312 --> 00:17:04,732
<i>And the reason why I'm telling you this…</i>

211
00:17:06,108 --> 00:17:07,568
<i>is because I need your help.</i>

212
00:17:09,153 --> 00:17:11,947
[laughs]

213
00:17:15,492 --> 00:17:16,493
<i>Me?</i>

214
00:17:17,244 --> 00:17:20,080
<i>Why me? Why not Julio?</i>

215
00:17:20,330 --> 00:17:21,498
<i>Why not your Mama?</i>

216
00:17:21,582 --> 00:17:22,708
[scoffs]

217
00:17:24,126 --> 00:17:26,754
<i>Well, we all know that</i>

218
00:17:27,463 --> 00:17:28,505
<i>Grandpa's getting old.</i>

219
00:17:29,465 --> 00:17:30,591
<i>He's weak.</i>

220
00:17:30,966 --> 00:17:32,176
<i>And Mom…</i>

221
00:17:33,010 --> 00:17:34,011
<i>Well…</i>

222
00:17:34,094 --> 00:17:36,346
<i>We both love her, but Mom is Mom.</i>

223
00:17:36,972 --> 00:17:39,475
<i>We both love her, but</i>
<i>we know she can't do much.</i>

224
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:42,436
<i>But you, you're something else.</i>

225
00:17:43,395 --> 00:17:45,731
<i>I'm in awe about everything</i>
<i>you achieved in here.</i>

226
00:17:45,814 --> 00:17:47,483
<i>-Your power.</i>
<i>-Uh-huh…</i>

227
00:17:48,275 --> 00:17:51,445
<i>And I believe you're</i>
<i>the only one who can help me.</i>

228
00:17:51,528 --> 00:17:52,529
<i>No one else.</i>

229
00:17:54,573 --> 00:17:57,701
<i>And I also believe that I can help you.</i>

230
00:18:01,413 --> 00:18:02,581
<i>What do you say?</i>

231
00:18:08,504 --> 00:18:10,297
I promised Arnaldo

232
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:14,176
I'd make everyone who wronged him pay.

233
00:18:16,553 --> 00:18:19,098
Something that Julio wasn't able to do,

234
00:18:19,181 --> 00:18:21,475
and apparently, you, baby girl,

235
00:18:21,558 --> 00:18:22,976
are not able to do as well.

236
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:27,064
[scoffs] You can't even finish
off your opponent.

237
00:18:27,815 --> 00:18:29,525
But then, I can't blame you.

238
00:18:29,608 --> 00:18:32,277
Because Julio didn't raise you right.

239
00:18:32,778 --> 00:18:34,071
But we can fix that.

240
00:18:34,154 --> 00:18:35,781
First-time jitters, Mama.

241
00:18:37,074 --> 00:18:39,326
I didn't even know
you couldn't kill up front.

242
00:18:39,409 --> 00:18:41,870
Because I don't get my hands dirty, Mama.

243
00:18:41,954 --> 00:18:44,206
I always ask someone to do it for me.

244
00:18:44,289 --> 00:18:45,958
I don't do my own dirty work.

245
00:18:46,041 --> 00:18:47,126
[Helena] Oh, Emilia.

246
00:18:47,209 --> 00:18:48,752
If you want to succeed in business,

247
00:18:48,836 --> 00:18:51,171
you need to be hands-on.

248
00:18:51,255 --> 00:18:52,297
But don't worry.

249
00:18:52,381 --> 00:18:54,800
Pretty soon, you're going
to get the killer instinct…

250
00:18:54,883 --> 00:18:56,260
-…like your son.
-But I do have…

251
00:18:56,343 --> 00:18:57,344
…a killer instinct, Mama.

252
00:18:57,427 --> 00:18:58,387
So prove it.

253
00:19:00,848 --> 00:19:01,890
[scoffs]

254
00:19:01,974 --> 00:19:04,893
I'm reserving it for someone
named Lily Cruz.

255
00:19:05,477 --> 00:19:07,020
You're not going to be
the one to kill her.

256
00:19:07,104 --> 00:19:08,856
Not even Papa. It's me.

257
00:19:08,939 --> 00:19:10,774
I'm gonna do it myself, Mama.

258
00:19:10,858 --> 00:19:12,943
[tense music playing]

259
00:19:16,947 --> 00:19:17,906
Welcome back.

260
00:19:18,615 --> 00:19:19,700
Thank you.

261
00:19:22,703 --> 00:19:25,205
[suspenseful music playing]

262
00:19:36,383 --> 00:19:38,051
<i>The Madam asks, a blindfold or a bullet?</i>

263
00:19:38,135 --> 00:19:39,386
<i>Your call.</i>

264
00:19:41,054 --> 00:19:43,140
[Red Dragon] <i>I'm sure you</i>
<i>already recognize my voice.</i>

265
00:19:43,223 --> 00:19:48,228
<i>Each and every one of you</i>
<i>has a reason to betray me.</i>

266
00:19:48,312 --> 00:19:52,316
<i>But there can only be one Judas here.</i>

267
00:19:52,983 --> 00:19:54,276
<i>Go ahead, baby girl.</i>

268
00:19:54,776 --> 00:19:57,863
<i>Give the traitor their last kiss.</i>

269
00:19:58,113 --> 00:20:00,616
<i>-Emilia! Do it now!</i>
<i>-I can't do it, Mama.</i>

270
00:20:00,699 --> 00:20:02,951
[gunshots]

271
00:20:03,035 --> 00:20:06,038
[suspenseful music playing]

272
00:20:10,959 --> 00:20:11,960
Jaguar.

273
00:20:13,670 --> 00:20:15,214
Did you notice anything off earlier?

274
00:20:18,217 --> 00:20:21,303
I have a feeling Red Dragon
didn't kill Mercedes.

275
00:20:21,637 --> 00:20:23,847
And it definitely wasn't Emilia.

276
00:20:23,931 --> 00:20:25,599
Someone else was there.

277
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:28,602
That person killed Mercedes.

278
00:20:29,311 --> 00:20:30,520
Mercedes is dead.

279
00:20:30,604 --> 00:20:32,064
Forget about her.

280
00:20:32,814 --> 00:20:34,358
Just focus on what could happen

281
00:20:34,441 --> 00:20:35,901
now that Red Dragon's back.

282
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:38,403
What do you mean?

283
00:20:38,487 --> 00:20:40,864
Red Dragon didn't
come back to kill Mercedes

284
00:20:40,948 --> 00:20:43,325
or to have the Big Four's
deaths investigated.

285
00:20:44,284 --> 00:20:45,661
Based on what I've heard…

286
00:20:46,453 --> 00:20:48,538
there will be an important transaction.

287
00:20:49,665 --> 00:20:52,709
Diego, get ready. Red Dragon will need us.

288
00:20:52,793 --> 00:20:55,587
[ominous music playing]

289
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:08,016
[Damian] <i>I told you everything I</i>
<i>know because I want to help you.</i>

290
00:21:09,101 --> 00:21:12,604
<i>I hope you and Lily use this</i>
<i>to take Red Dragon down.</i>

291
00:21:19,194 --> 00:21:20,195
Lily.

292
00:21:20,654 --> 00:21:22,239
Agent Salonga called.

293
00:21:22,322 --> 00:21:25,325
They found the corpse of
one of Red Dragon's people,

294
00:21:25,409 --> 00:21:27,286
and they can't identify whose body it is.

295
00:21:27,369 --> 00:21:29,955
[tense music playing]

296
00:21:51,727 --> 00:21:55,314
[suspenseful music playing]

297
00:22:07,117 --> 00:22:08,118
[beep]

298
00:22:18,420 --> 00:22:21,423
[suspenseful music playing]

299
00:22:31,266 --> 00:22:33,185
[Romulo] Okay, I'll call you back later.

300
00:22:34,394 --> 00:22:35,479
Okay.

301
00:22:38,231 --> 00:22:39,357
[Romulo] Get ready.

302
00:22:39,441 --> 00:22:42,069
We have an important
transaction for Red Dragon.

303
00:22:42,152 --> 00:22:44,237
It's with her partners from abroad.

304
00:22:44,321 --> 00:22:46,615
Millions of pesos are at stake here,

305
00:22:46,698 --> 00:22:48,825
along with Red Dragon's reputation

306
00:22:48,909 --> 00:22:51,078
as the number one syndicate
leader in the country.

307
00:22:51,578 --> 00:22:52,579
Is that clear?

308
00:22:53,538 --> 00:22:55,082
That's all. You're dismissed.

309
00:22:55,165 --> 00:22:57,209
[suspenseful music playing]

310
00:23:14,392 --> 00:23:18,105
[suspenseful music continues]

311
00:23:58,937 --> 00:23:59,855
[beeps]

312
00:23:59,938 --> 00:24:01,523
[Romulo] <i>Get ready.</i>

313
00:24:01,606 --> 00:24:03,984
<i>We have an important</i>
<i>transaction for Red Dragon.</i>

314
00:24:04,067 --> 00:24:06,403
<i>It's with her partners from abroad.</i>

315
00:24:06,486 --> 00:24:08,655
<i>Millions of pesos are at stake here,</i>

316
00:24:08,738 --> 00:24:10,448
<i>along with Red Dragon's reputation</i>

317
00:24:10,532 --> 00:24:13,118
<i>as the number one</i>
<i>syndicate leader in the country.</i>

318
00:24:13,201 --> 00:24:14,536
<i>Is that clear?</i>

319
00:24:14,995 --> 00:24:15,996
[beeps]

320
00:24:16,079 --> 00:24:18,582
[suspenseful music playing]

321
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:24,504
-[unsettling music playing]
-[camera shutters clicking]

322
00:24:33,972 --> 00:24:35,182
Agent Salonga.

323
00:24:36,933 --> 00:24:37,809
Lily.

324
00:24:38,935 --> 00:24:41,146
We haven't identified the corpse yet, but…

325
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:44,524
There's a message.

326
00:24:44,608 --> 00:24:45,775
"DON'T BE A TRAITOR LIKE ME." RD

327
00:24:51,031 --> 00:24:51,865
Open it.

328
00:24:53,575 --> 00:24:54,868
Go ahead and open it.

329
00:24:54,951 --> 00:24:56,578
[unsettling music continues playing]

330
00:25:17,515 --> 00:25:19,893
[unsettling music continues playing]

331
00:25:29,194 --> 00:25:31,488
I warned her, Agent Salonga.

332
00:25:32,614 --> 00:25:34,324
I tried to convince her to join my side,

333
00:25:34,407 --> 00:25:35,825
but she refused.

334
00:25:35,909 --> 00:25:39,037
She chose to side with the demon.

335
00:25:43,333 --> 00:25:45,585
I feel sorry for you, Mercedes.

336
00:25:45,669 --> 00:25:47,963
[unsettling music playing]

337
00:26:02,060 --> 00:26:03,937
[music fading]

338
00:26:06,856 --> 00:26:07,941
[door opens]

339
00:26:10,193 --> 00:26:11,403
[door closes]

340
00:26:11,486 --> 00:26:13,989
[tense music playing]

341
00:26:21,955 --> 00:26:24,332
Well, well, well…

342
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:26,584
This is more I like it.

343
00:26:26,668 --> 00:26:28,086
That's what I've been telling you.

344
00:26:28,670 --> 00:26:31,631
You should dress up appropriately.

345
00:26:31,715 --> 00:26:32,716
See?

346
00:26:32,799 --> 00:26:36,469
It just might even help
bring back your memory.

347
00:26:38,972 --> 00:26:41,766
Yes, you're right. I took your advice.

348
00:26:42,642 --> 00:26:44,477
You told me to wear something appropriate,

349
00:26:44,561 --> 00:26:47,522
and I found this in my room, so I wore it.

350
00:26:47,605 --> 00:26:50,108
-That's good. That's good.
-By the way…

351
00:26:51,276 --> 00:26:52,986
I'm here to return this.

352
00:26:56,573 --> 00:26:57,615
Uh…

353
00:26:58,575 --> 00:27:00,243
It helped me out a lot.

354
00:27:01,953 --> 00:27:04,706
"The truth shall set you free."

355
00:27:05,832 --> 00:27:07,751
That's what you meant, right?

356
00:27:07,834 --> 00:27:09,711
Right. Right, you are.

357
00:27:09,794 --> 00:27:10,795
You're right.

358
00:27:11,463 --> 00:27:12,881
It opened my eyes.

359
00:27:15,550 --> 00:27:18,219
It's fresh in my mind…

360
00:27:18,303 --> 00:27:21,848
The betrayal of Lily Cruz and her friends.

361
00:27:21,931 --> 00:27:24,392
[tense music playing]

362
00:27:26,978 --> 00:27:28,480
Lily Cruz…

363
00:27:29,689 --> 00:27:33,276
whom I knew as Ivy Aguas.

364
00:27:37,155 --> 00:27:39,741
My ex-fiancée.

365
00:27:41,576 --> 00:27:45,413
The wildflower that ruined me!

366
00:27:45,497 --> 00:27:46,706
[loud thud]

367
00:27:47,707 --> 00:27:49,834
Arnaldo. Arnaldo?

368
00:27:50,377 --> 00:27:51,503
-I--
-[heavy breathing]

369
00:27:51,586 --> 00:27:53,380
Arnaldo, are you back?

370
00:27:53,463 --> 00:27:55,548
Is this… Is this the Arnaldo I raised?

371
00:27:55,632 --> 00:27:57,842
The Arnaldo I mentored?

372
00:27:58,802 --> 00:28:00,178
Are you back?!

373
00:28:02,847 --> 00:28:03,848
Arnaldo?

374
00:28:03,932 --> 00:28:05,975
[tense music playing]

375
00:28:10,688 --> 00:28:11,689
[Arnaldo] Mmm!

376
00:28:12,690 --> 00:28:14,025
This is really good.

377
00:28:14,609 --> 00:28:16,194
But to answer your question…

378
00:28:16,277 --> 00:28:17,529
Yes, I'm back.

379
00:28:17,612 --> 00:28:19,864
[guffaws] Damn! You got me going!

380
00:28:19,948 --> 00:28:21,825
-I got you, didn't I? Yes?
-Yes, yes, yes!

381
00:28:21,908 --> 00:28:23,785
-Come here!
-Ah…

382
00:28:24,452 --> 00:28:25,870
-I missed you.
-Whoa!

383
00:28:25,954 --> 00:28:27,580
I missed you.

384
00:28:28,248 --> 00:28:32,085
There's no other greater gift than this!

385
00:28:32,752 --> 00:28:35,713
Arnaldo, my grandson, is back!

386
00:28:37,632 --> 00:28:38,925
From the dead!

387
00:28:39,008 --> 00:28:41,177
You're a bad boy!

388
00:28:41,261 --> 00:28:43,346
-You got me going for a while.
-Well…

389
00:28:43,972 --> 00:28:46,766
[sighs] I missed my
old self. I missed this place.

390
00:28:46,850 --> 00:28:48,393
I missed you. I missed everyone.

391
00:28:48,476 --> 00:28:49,519
I missed this suit.

392
00:28:49,602 --> 00:28:51,604
-Welcome back!
-[Arnaldo sighs]

393
00:28:51,688 --> 00:28:53,064
Wait, wait, wait…

394
00:28:53,148 --> 00:28:53,982
Mm-hmm?

395
00:28:54,441 --> 00:28:58,820
Who else knows that you're back?

396
00:28:59,112 --> 00:29:00,238
Aside from me, who else?

397
00:29:00,321 --> 00:29:02,615
Well, it's just Mom and Grandma.

398
00:29:03,158 --> 00:29:04,242
Whoa!

399
00:29:04,325 --> 00:29:07,620
You got to meet the Red Dragon!

400
00:29:07,704 --> 00:29:10,498
-Oh, yes! Definitely, I did!
-[Julio guffaws]

401
00:29:10,582 --> 00:29:12,584
And you know what? In fact…

402
00:29:12,667 --> 00:29:15,170
she reminds me of you a lot.

403
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:17,589
You know? Same anger.

404
00:29:17,672 --> 00:29:19,215
Same ruthlessness.

405
00:29:19,299 --> 00:29:20,717
I've got news for you.

406
00:29:21,009 --> 00:29:23,720
Your grandmother is infuriated right now

407
00:29:23,803 --> 00:29:26,306
because I had all her allies killed.

408
00:29:26,848 --> 00:29:30,393
I ordered the killing of the Big Four.

409
00:29:30,477 --> 00:29:31,394
Why not?!

410
00:29:31,936 --> 00:29:34,689
I just took back what they stole from me.

411
00:29:34,773 --> 00:29:36,107
They stole my gambling houses

412
00:29:36,191 --> 00:29:38,485
and my other businesses.

413
00:29:39,152 --> 00:29:40,737
Okay. Let me guess.

414
00:29:41,696 --> 00:29:43,114
You set it up…

415
00:29:43,364 --> 00:29:47,118
in a way that would look like
someone else did it

416
00:29:47,202 --> 00:29:48,453
so they'd kill each other.

417
00:29:48,536 --> 00:29:51,623
-You truly are back!
-I knew it.

418
00:29:51,706 --> 00:29:54,083
-Great minds think alike.
-[Arnaldo guffaws]

419
00:29:54,167 --> 00:29:55,585
And like I told you,

420
00:29:55,668 --> 00:29:59,339
you're the only one who deserves
to be in my place,

421
00:29:59,422 --> 00:30:03,009
in my throne, and of course,
your newfound grandmother's.

422
00:30:03,760 --> 00:30:04,928
-[sighs]
-[Arnaldo chuckles]

423
00:30:05,178 --> 00:30:06,554
Okay, well…

424
00:30:06,930 --> 00:30:08,598
I've got news for you.

425
00:30:08,932 --> 00:30:10,266
Grandma likes me a lot.

426
00:30:10,350 --> 00:30:13,144
-Wow! [guffaws]
-She likes me so much.

427
00:30:13,228 --> 00:30:14,687
In fact…

428
00:30:14,771 --> 00:30:17,357
she gave me lots of information
about her group.

429
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:19,275
So, here's what I'm gonna do for you.

430
00:30:19,692 --> 00:30:22,403
I'm gonna be your eyes
and ears in their group.

431
00:30:22,487 --> 00:30:23,446
-Okay?
-[snaps fingers]

432
00:30:23,530 --> 00:30:24,864
And then, eventually…

433
00:30:25,949 --> 00:30:28,868
we are gonna take back our business.

434
00:30:28,952 --> 00:30:29,828
Of course.

435
00:30:29,911 --> 00:30:30,995
[Arnaldo] And…

436
00:30:31,204 --> 00:30:33,581
we're even gonna take her business.

437
00:30:33,665 --> 00:30:35,959
-Okay?
-Okay, rightfully so!

438
00:30:36,042 --> 00:30:38,962
[suspenseful music playing]

439
00:30:42,799 --> 00:30:43,800
Diego.

440
00:30:47,804 --> 00:30:49,305
I'm sorry I made you worry.

441
00:30:49,389 --> 00:30:50,974
I'm glad you're safe.

442
00:30:51,224 --> 00:30:52,684
I thought I lost you.

443
00:30:53,268 --> 00:30:54,811
No, I won't let that happen.

444
00:30:55,228 --> 00:30:56,604
-I'll make sure it won't.
-Let's go.

445
00:30:56,688 --> 00:30:58,064
Come with me.

446
00:30:58,147 --> 00:30:59,691
Cut your ties with Red Dragon.

447
00:31:00,900 --> 00:31:02,026
Lily.

448
00:31:02,819 --> 00:31:06,948
This could be our last chance
to take down Red Dragon.

449
00:31:09,492 --> 00:31:10,994
The reason she came back here

450
00:31:11,077 --> 00:31:13,413
is that she has
a huge transaction coming up.

451
00:31:13,496 --> 00:31:15,123
We have to catch her.

452
00:31:17,584 --> 00:31:19,460
A huge transaction?

453
00:31:22,130 --> 00:31:24,507
Then we'll intercept
that transaction, Diego.

454
00:31:24,591 --> 00:31:28,928
Just tell me the time, date, and place…

455
00:31:29,012 --> 00:31:31,306
so we can finally put
a muzzle over her mouth.

456
00:31:31,890 --> 00:31:32,974
Yes, I'll do that.

457
00:31:33,057 --> 00:31:34,100
But I have to go.

458
00:31:34,183 --> 00:31:35,810
They might get more suspicious.

459
00:31:35,894 --> 00:31:39,147
[tense music playing]

460
00:31:41,941 --> 00:31:43,526
Just be patient, Lily.

461
00:31:44,235 --> 00:31:48,573
It won't be long before all this is over.

462
00:31:51,743 --> 00:31:53,077
-I have to go.
-Be careful.

463
00:31:53,161 --> 00:31:54,537
And text me when you get there.

464
00:31:54,621 --> 00:31:55,496
I will.

465
00:31:55,580 --> 00:31:57,415
[tense music playing]

466
00:32:02,712 --> 00:32:03,588
Now…

467
00:32:03,671 --> 00:32:06,925
going back to the group
of Lily Cruz and friends…

468
00:32:07,842 --> 00:32:11,679
As long as they think
that I'm virtuous, or…

469
00:32:11,763 --> 00:32:14,682
I don't know, angelic,
saintly, whatever you call it,

470
00:32:15,308 --> 00:32:16,935
I'll keep an eye on them.

471
00:32:18,144 --> 00:32:22,482
They'll never suspect they've
let a wolf into their midst.

472
00:32:22,565 --> 00:32:25,026
[guffaws]

473
00:32:26,736 --> 00:32:29,906
Oh! I am starting to really love this.

474
00:32:29,989 --> 00:32:31,282
And you…

475
00:32:31,366 --> 00:32:33,910
You are going to give them a taste

476
00:32:33,993 --> 00:32:37,747
of their own bitter medicine.

477
00:32:37,830 --> 00:32:39,874
Exactly!

478
00:32:39,958 --> 00:32:43,503
You know what? It turns
out that being shot…

479
00:32:44,295 --> 00:32:46,130
was a blessing in disguise.

480
00:32:46,214 --> 00:32:48,633
You truly are back.

481
00:32:48,716 --> 00:32:51,219
-And you're so scary.
-[Arnaldo grunts]

482
00:32:51,302 --> 00:32:52,762
You're just like me!

483
00:32:52,845 --> 00:32:54,889
Even more than me. Ha!

484
00:32:54,973 --> 00:32:59,102
-[laughs menacingly]
-[ominous music playing]

485
00:32:59,185 --> 00:33:00,353
Ah!

486
00:33:00,436 --> 00:33:01,688
I love this!

487
00:33:02,397 --> 00:33:04,357
My grandson is back!

488
00:33:05,274 --> 00:33:06,401
Cheers.

489
00:33:08,945 --> 00:33:10,613
Okay, we're all set.

490
00:33:10,697 --> 00:33:12,824
Kindly put the other decorations inside.

491
00:33:13,116 --> 00:33:14,117
Thank you.

492
00:33:18,287 --> 00:33:19,330
[Damian] Camia.

493
00:33:21,290 --> 00:33:22,333
Hey, Damian.

494
00:33:24,669 --> 00:33:27,171
[soft music playing]

495
00:33:37,807 --> 00:33:38,975
Damian?

496
00:33:40,309 --> 00:33:41,519
What's wrong?

497
00:33:42,729 --> 00:33:43,896
I'm sorry.

498
00:33:44,313 --> 00:33:45,690
I got into a car accident earlier.

499
00:33:45,773 --> 00:33:47,483
I thought I wouldn't survive.

500
00:33:48,234 --> 00:33:49,360
Accident?

501
00:33:49,944 --> 00:33:53,531
-Are you hurt, Damian?
-No. I'm fine. I'm all right.

502
00:33:54,073 --> 00:33:55,283
Are you sure?

503
00:33:55,366 --> 00:33:56,534
[Camia sighs]

504
00:33:56,617 --> 00:33:58,202
You should sit down first.

505
00:33:58,786 --> 00:34:01,664
I'll get you something to drink.
Come on, Damian.

506
00:34:01,748 --> 00:34:04,667
[soft music continues playing]

507
00:34:14,218 --> 00:34:15,970
So, you were in Macau?

508
00:34:16,596 --> 00:34:17,638
Yes.

509
00:34:19,015 --> 00:34:20,433
Who brought you there?

510
00:34:21,976 --> 00:34:24,562
People who invested in our organization.

511
00:34:24,645 --> 00:34:26,230
They made sure of my safety

512
00:34:26,314 --> 00:34:28,900
because the fate
of their transactions here

513
00:34:28,983 --> 00:34:31,194
rests in my hands.

514
00:34:31,277 --> 00:34:33,404
You mean to say you have
friends from other countries?

515
00:34:33,488 --> 00:34:34,906
But of course.

516
00:34:34,989 --> 00:34:36,908
When will I meet them, Mama?

517
00:34:36,991 --> 00:34:37,992
Oh. Tsk.

518
00:34:38,076 --> 00:34:40,119
I don't really think
this is the right time.

519
00:34:40,203 --> 00:34:41,329
The situation's too chaotic.

520
00:34:42,413 --> 00:34:44,040
You know, I must admit.

521
00:34:44,582 --> 00:34:47,794
I panicked when Mercedes
had the Big Four killed.

522
00:34:47,877 --> 00:34:51,839
But thanks to you,
we discovered the real traitor.

523
00:34:51,923 --> 00:34:53,049
I know, Mama.

524
00:34:53,132 --> 00:34:55,259
The first time I saw her,

525
00:34:55,343 --> 00:34:57,345
I knew she was a two-faced hag.

526
00:34:57,428 --> 00:34:59,639
And she was the only one
who survived the meeting.

527
00:34:59,722 --> 00:35:00,973
I mean, that's impossible.

528
00:35:01,057 --> 00:35:02,517
So, Emilia,

529
00:35:02,600 --> 00:35:05,269
you need to keep your eyes
peeled at all times.

530
00:35:05,353 --> 00:35:07,814
Lots of people want to steal our position.

531
00:35:08,147 --> 00:35:10,108
All of this will be yours one day.

532
00:35:10,191 --> 00:35:12,610
It has to stay within our family.

533
00:35:13,903 --> 00:35:15,321
I'll make sure of that, Mama.

534
00:35:15,404 --> 00:35:18,157
[sinister music playing]

535
00:35:23,037 --> 00:35:24,163
[Camia] Damian.

536
00:35:25,164 --> 00:35:26,791
Here, drink this.

537
00:35:26,874 --> 00:35:27,750
Thank you.

538
00:35:34,006 --> 00:35:35,007
Come here.

539
00:35:42,056 --> 00:35:45,143
Damian, did anyone else
get hurt in the accident?

540
00:35:46,978 --> 00:35:47,979
Just one person.

541
00:35:50,064 --> 00:35:52,900
But because of that,
I realized life is short.

542
00:35:54,819 --> 00:35:57,280
You can die in a blink of an eye,

543
00:35:58,656 --> 00:36:00,950
and you'll never see
your loved ones again.

544
00:36:03,494 --> 00:36:07,248
That's why if you love someone,

545
00:36:08,666 --> 00:36:10,918
you need to express how you feel,

546
00:36:11,002 --> 00:36:12,503
so you won't have any regrets.

547
00:36:12,587 --> 00:36:15,381
[romantic music playing]

548
00:36:36,986 --> 00:36:39,822
[romantic music continues playing]

549
00:36:58,883 --> 00:36:59,967
[Lily] Mom?

550
00:37:01,219 --> 00:37:02,595
-Mom!
-Yes, Lily?

551
00:37:03,429 --> 00:37:04,430
Mom.

552
00:37:05,473 --> 00:37:07,934
Diego and I met up
and came up with a new plan

553
00:37:08,017 --> 00:37:10,102
to take down Red Dragon.

554
00:37:10,978 --> 00:37:15,441
For now, I need your help
contacting Agent Salonga.

555
00:37:15,983 --> 00:37:17,860
-Follow me inside, okay?
-All right, dear.

556
00:37:17,944 --> 00:37:18,986
I'll be right there.

557
00:37:19,070 --> 00:37:22,406
[tense music swelling]

558
00:37:31,123 --> 00:37:33,876
There will be a big transaction
tomorrow night.

559
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:36,796
And the shipment must not be delayed

560
00:37:36,879 --> 00:37:38,673
because there's a lot of money involved.

561
00:37:39,465 --> 00:37:42,301
Romulo will be here
to take care of everything.

562
00:37:42,385 --> 00:37:43,386
Why him?

563
00:37:43,469 --> 00:37:45,638
Haven't I proven my competence, Mama?

564
00:37:45,721 --> 00:37:47,181
Especially after I discovered

565
00:37:47,265 --> 00:37:48,933
the traitor in your organization?

566
00:37:49,016 --> 00:37:50,893
It's Romulo who knows

567
00:37:50,977 --> 00:37:52,728
how to deal with shipments like this.

568
00:37:52,812 --> 00:37:55,147
He could be my adviser, Mama.

569
00:37:55,231 --> 00:37:56,565
You have to give me a chance.

570
00:37:56,649 --> 00:37:58,734
How can I learn if you won't give me one?

571
00:37:58,818 --> 00:38:00,987
I did give you a chance, Emilia.

572
00:38:01,070 --> 00:38:03,197
And the Big Four died, remember?

573
00:38:03,281 --> 00:38:04,782
But that won't happen again, Mama,

574
00:38:04,865 --> 00:38:07,076
because the traitor in the group is gone.

575
00:38:08,536 --> 00:38:09,495
[sighs]

576
00:38:09,578 --> 00:38:10,746
All right.

577
00:38:11,080 --> 00:38:12,999
I'm going to give you another chance.

578
00:38:13,082 --> 00:38:14,125
[claps] Yay!

579
00:38:14,208 --> 00:38:15,918
I'll make you proud, Mama.

580
00:38:16,002 --> 00:38:18,045
-Don't disappoint me.
-I won't.

581
00:38:19,380 --> 00:38:20,756
[Helena] All right.

582
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,758
You and Romulo talk about the details.

583
00:38:22,842 --> 00:38:25,011
-Mm-hm.
-I need to rest.

584
00:38:25,094 --> 00:38:26,929
[tense music playing]

585
00:38:30,766 --> 00:38:32,018
And you…

586
00:38:32,101 --> 00:38:34,186
Mercedes 2.0?

587
00:38:34,270 --> 00:38:37,940
You'll really do everything you
can to rise in the ranks, huh?

588
00:38:38,024 --> 00:38:39,859
And what do you mean by that?

589
00:38:40,484 --> 00:38:43,529
Mercedes treated Red Dragon like a mother.

590
00:38:43,863 --> 00:38:45,364
She couldn't have been the traitor.

591
00:38:45,448 --> 00:38:47,241
Correct, that's why she
threw Mama under the bus

592
00:38:47,325 --> 00:38:48,868
because she's jealous.

593
00:38:48,951 --> 00:38:53,539
If you're going to question me,
I could tell Mama that

594
00:38:53,622 --> 00:38:55,166
you have a problem with me.

595
00:38:55,249 --> 00:38:57,626
You know, we can easily replace you

596
00:38:57,710 --> 00:39:00,254
and look for another version of Mercedes.

597
00:39:01,213 --> 00:39:02,298
Well?

598
00:39:02,757 --> 00:39:03,966
Are we good?

599
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:05,801
Are we?!

600
00:39:06,385 --> 00:39:07,553
Bye!

601
00:39:08,220 --> 00:39:09,055
Scram!

602
00:39:10,348 --> 00:39:11,515
Faster!

603
00:39:11,599 --> 00:39:13,809
[tense music playing]

604
00:39:17,063 --> 00:39:18,064
[scoffs]

605
00:39:22,610 --> 00:39:25,404
[sinister laugh]

606
00:39:25,488 --> 00:39:26,906
[sighs]

607
00:39:32,370 --> 00:39:34,538
Agent Salonga, my contact told me

608
00:39:34,622 --> 00:39:38,376
a shipment will be transported
abroad tomorrow night.

609
00:39:38,459 --> 00:39:42,380
And Red Dragon will oversee
the transaction herself.

610
00:39:43,089 --> 00:39:45,049
Money isn't the only thing at stake here.

611
00:39:45,341 --> 00:39:47,426
Her reputation is, as well.

612
00:39:47,510 --> 00:39:51,180
She needs to show she still
has control over the syndicates.

613
00:39:53,432 --> 00:39:55,518
When will we meet your intel?

614
00:39:55,601 --> 00:39:57,686
[tense music playing]

615
00:40:03,192 --> 00:40:06,987
Once you arrest Red Dragon, and
once she loses all her power.

616
00:40:07,238 --> 00:40:08,656
I'm sorry, Agent Salonga.

617
00:40:08,739 --> 00:40:11,909
I can't reveal my intel's identity.

618
00:40:13,702 --> 00:40:17,081
I have to admit, Miss Cruz,
this isn't how we operate.

619
00:40:17,581 --> 00:40:21,085
But if this is the only way
to catch Red Dragon,

620
00:40:21,419 --> 00:40:22,628
we'll follow your lead.

621
00:40:23,796 --> 00:40:25,840
This is the closest we've gotten to her.

622
00:40:26,966 --> 00:40:28,592
And it's because of your help.

623
00:40:29,051 --> 00:40:30,052
Thank you.

624
00:40:30,428 --> 00:40:32,638
Thank you too, Agent Salonga.

625
00:40:32,721 --> 00:40:36,058
This is our best shot
at catching Red Dragon.

626
00:40:38,686 --> 00:40:41,313
That's why we can't fail.

627
00:40:44,066 --> 00:40:48,404
[suspenseful music swells]

628
00:40:54,702 --> 00:40:57,580
[pensive music playing]

629
00:41:17,057 --> 00:41:18,184
Hey!

630
00:41:18,267 --> 00:41:19,894
You're spacing out again.

631
00:41:20,936 --> 00:41:22,438
Did you have another fight with Jepoy?

632
00:41:23,439 --> 00:41:24,899
What was it this time?

633
00:41:27,151 --> 00:41:29,153
Marlon, Jepoy loves me.

634
00:41:29,778 --> 00:41:31,197
He really does.

635
00:41:33,073 --> 00:41:35,534
Well, there you go.
So, what's with the long face?

636
00:41:36,202 --> 00:41:37,411
I was wrong.

637
00:41:38,162 --> 00:41:39,955
I misunderstood him.

638
00:41:40,789 --> 00:41:42,041
But I'll make it up to him.

639
00:41:42,124 --> 00:41:44,168
[soft music playing]

640
00:41:46,545 --> 00:41:48,047
Anyway, Marlon, I have to go.

641
00:42:00,601 --> 00:42:03,646
[foreboding music playing]

642
00:42:21,747 --> 00:42:24,500
[music continues]

643
00:43:18,679 --> 00:43:21,599
[unsettling music playing]

644
00:43:25,185 --> 00:43:27,104
[Lily gasps, coughs]

645
00:43:27,980 --> 00:43:29,023
Arnaldo--

646
00:43:29,565 --> 00:43:33,402
[Lily breathing raggedly]

647
00:43:33,819 --> 00:43:35,362
-[Lily coughs]
-Yes.

648
00:43:35,446 --> 00:43:38,240
[breathes raggedly, groans]

649
00:43:38,324 --> 00:43:40,909
-Yes, yes…
-Arnaldo! [groans]

650
00:43:41,702 --> 00:43:43,162
Arnaldo!

651
00:43:43,245 --> 00:43:47,791
[coughs, wheezes]

652
00:43:47,875 --> 00:43:48,876
Arnaldo, please!

653
00:43:48,959 --> 00:43:51,462
[groans, coughs]

654
00:43:51,545 --> 00:43:53,172
-[Arnaldo whispering]
-[ragged breathing]

655
00:43:53,255 --> 00:43:56,050
Arnaldo! [coughs]

656
00:43:57,134 --> 00:43:58,802
[Lily groans]

657
00:44:00,846 --> 00:44:04,600
-[Lily breathes raggedly]
-[suspenseful music playing]

658
00:44:05,351 --> 00:44:06,352
[Lily groans]

659
00:44:07,269 --> 00:44:08,228
[Lily groans]

660
00:44:08,312 --> 00:44:11,565
-[heavy breathing]
-[water running]

661
00:44:17,321 --> 00:44:21,200
[unsettling music playing]

662
00:44:21,283 --> 00:44:23,118
[chuckles]

663
00:44:23,202 --> 00:44:24,286
Lily…

664
00:44:30,209 --> 00:44:32,836
[unsettling music playing]

665
00:44:35,964 --> 00:44:36,799
Uh…

666
00:44:36,882 --> 00:44:38,384
-Lily.
-Arnaldo.

667
00:44:38,717 --> 00:44:40,010
What are you doing here?

668
00:44:40,636 --> 00:44:41,679
Uh…

669
00:44:41,762 --> 00:44:44,139
It's been days since
Diego came to visit me.

670
00:44:44,223 --> 00:44:45,224
Is he there?

671
00:44:47,685 --> 00:44:49,978
No. Diego isn't here.

672
00:44:50,062 --> 00:44:53,565
I don't know where he is.
Maybe he's at work.

673
00:44:53,649 --> 00:44:55,150
Is that so?

674
00:44:55,234 --> 00:44:59,696
Don't you two ever text or call?

675
00:45:00,197 --> 00:45:01,198
Not at all?

676
00:45:03,826 --> 00:45:04,827
No.

677
00:45:05,994 --> 00:45:07,913
Arnaldo, I suggest you go home now.

678
00:45:07,996 --> 00:45:10,332
I'm sure that your brother will visit you.

679
00:45:10,416 --> 00:45:12,626
[unsettling music continues playing]

680
00:45:17,005 --> 00:45:18,715
Uh… I'll open it for you.

681
00:45:31,437 --> 00:45:32,396
[car engine turns over]

682
00:45:39,111 --> 00:45:40,112
Let's go.

683
00:45:44,783 --> 00:45:45,909
[sighs]

684
00:45:49,163 --> 00:45:52,541
[suspenseful music playing]

685
00:45:54,251 --> 00:45:57,588
[sighs] You haven't changed, Lily.

686
00:45:59,339 --> 00:46:00,841
You still smell so good

687
00:46:02,301 --> 00:46:05,637
even though you're rotten to the core.

688
00:46:06,847 --> 00:46:09,933
[suspenseful music playing]

689
00:46:15,397 --> 00:46:16,482
[Noel] <i>It's a wiretapping device.</i>

690
00:46:16,565 --> 00:46:19,401
<i>That way, we can record and listen in</i>
<i>on Red Dragon's transaction.</i>

691
00:46:19,485 --> 00:46:22,696
[Lily] <i>If something doesn't go as planned,</i>
<i>we'll be there right away.</i>

692
00:46:22,779 --> 00:46:24,990
[Helena] <i>Emilia will</i>
<i>eventually lead our group,</i>

693
00:46:25,073 --> 00:46:26,950
<i>so I want you to respect her.</i>
<i>Do you understand?</i>

694
00:46:27,784 --> 00:46:30,287
[Lily] <i>I'll see you at</i>
<i>the finish line, Red Dragon.</i>

695
00:46:30,370 --> 00:46:32,664
<i>And may the best woman win.</i>

696
00:46:33,165 --> 00:46:36,877
[Helena] <i>The one and only</i>
<i>Red Dragon will rise.</i>

697
00:46:36,960 --> 00:46:38,670
<i>I knew it! You're a traitor!</i>

698
00:46:38,754 --> 00:46:39,922
<i>Madam, he's spying on us!</i>

699
00:46:40,005 --> 00:46:41,465
[Noel] <i>Police! Don't move!</i>

700
00:46:41,548 --> 00:46:43,091
[gunshots]

701
00:46:43,175 --> 00:46:44,718
[screams]

702
00:46:44,801 --> 00:46:46,887
<i>Let's move! What are you waiting for?</i>

703
00:46:46,970 --> 00:46:48,180
[suspenseful music playing]

704
00:46:48,263 --> 00:46:50,098
[theme music playing]
